  "proved_within_model": [
    "Local conservation: retained share plus all child shares equals incoming share exactly.",
    "For a full b-ary hierarchy, level-k total mass is (b/(b+1))^k.",
    "Hence the infinite total mass is b+1 for every finite b>=1.",
    "The local law contains no free attenuation parameter."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Total mass is an observable, not a complete identity invariant.",
    "Equal sharing follows only when child branches are locally indistinguishable except for their existence/order.",
    "If future geometry gives unequal branch strengths, replace equal shares by normalized positive local weights."
